/** æ’å â†’ å±•ç¤ºè‰²ï¼šå‰ä¸‰åå¥–ç‰Œè‰²ï¼Œå…¶ä½™ç”¨æ¬¡è¦æ–‡æœ¬è‰² */
function rankColor(rank: number): Resource {
  if (rank === 1) {
    return $r('app.color.medal_gold')
  } else if (rank === 2) {
    return $r('app.color.medal_silver')
  } else if (rank === 3) {
    return $r('app.color.medal_bronze')
  }
  return $r('app.color.secondary_text')
}

@Builder
export function initLeaderboard(name: string) {
  LeaderboardPage()
}

/**
 * ç­¾åˆ°æ’è¡Œæ¦œé¡µï¼šå±•ç¤ºå…¨å¹³å°ç”¨æˆ·æŒ‰ã€Œå½“å‰è¿ç»­å¤©æ•°ã€æ’åºçš„äº‘ç«¯æ¦œå•
 * ï¼ˆæ•°æ®æ¥è‡ª Cloudflare Worker + D1 å…¬å¼€åªè¯»æ¥å£ /leaderboardï¼Œç”± LeaderboardReporter æ‹‰å–ï¼‰
 */
@Component
struct LeaderboardPage {
  @State entries: LeaderboardEntry[] = [];
  @State isLoading: boolean = true;
  @State isRefreshing: boolean = false;
  @StorageProp('statusBarHeight') statusBarHeight: number = 0; // EntryAbility å®æµ‹çš„çŠ¶æ€æ é«˜åº¦
  private pathInfos: NavPathStack = new NavPathStack();
  private listScroller: Scroller = new Scroller(); // æ ‡é¢˜æ æ¸å˜æ¨¡ç³Šçš„æ»šåŠ¨ç»‘å®šæº
  // 6.1(23) èµ·æ”¯æŒæ²‰æµ¸å…‰æ„Ÿæè´¨ï¼Œä½ç‰ˆæœ¬ç³»ç»Ÿèµ°é»˜è®¤æ ·å¼ï¼ˆé¦–é¡µåŒæ¬¾ï¼‰
  private readonly supportFloatingBar: boolean = deviceInfo.sdkApiVersion >= 23

  private async loadData() {
    try {
      this.entries = await LeaderboardReporter.fetchLeaderboard(LEADERBOARD_LIMIT)
    } catch (e) {
      hilog.error(DOMAIN, TAG, `Failed to load leaderboard: ${(e as Error).message}`)
      promptAction.showToast({ message: 'æ’è¡Œæ¦œåŠ è½½å¤±è´¥' })
    } finally {
      this.isLoading = false
      this.isRefreshing = false
    }
  }

  /** æ¦œå•è¯´æ˜å¡ç‰‡ï¼šæ’åºå£å¾„ + ä¸Šæ¦œäººæ•° */
  @Builder
  SummaryCard() {
    Column() {
      Text('æ’è¡Œæ¦œ')
        .fontSize(16).fontWeight(FontWeight.Medium)
        .fontColor($r('app.color.primary_text')).width('100%')
      Text(`å…± ${this.entries.length} äººä¸Šæ¦œ Â· æŒ‰ã€Œå½“å‰è¿ç»­å¤©æ•°ã€æ’åºï¼ŒåŒå¤©æ¯”ç´¯è®¡æ¬¡æ•°`)
        .fontSize(12).fontColor($r('app.color.secondary_text'))
        .width('100%').margin({ top: 6 })
    }
    .alignItems(HorizontalAlign.Start)
    .padding(14).width('100%')
    .backgroundColor($r('app.color.card_background'))
    .borderRadius(14)
  }

  @Builder
  RankItem(entry: LeaderboardEntry, rank: number) {
    Row() {
      Text(`${rank}`)
        .fontSize(16).fontWeight(FontWeight.Bold)
        .fontColor(rankColor(rank))
        .width(32).textAlign(TextAlign.Center)
      Column() {
        Text(entry.display_name)
          .fontSize(15).fontWeight(FontWeight.Medium)
          .fontColor($r('app.color.primary_text'))
          .maxLines(1)
          .textOverflow({ overflow: TextOverflow.Ellipsis })
        Text(`ç´¯è®¡ ${entry.total_signs} æ¬¡ï¼ˆ${entry.total_days} å¤©ï¼‰ Â· æœ¬å‘¨ ${entry.week_signs} æ¬¡ Â· æœ€é•¿è¿ç»­ ${entry.longest_streak} å¤©`)
          .fontSize(12).fontColor($r('app.color.secondary_text'))
          .maxLines(1)
          .textOverflow({ overflow: TextOverflow.Ellipsis })
          .margin({ top: 3 })
      }
      .layoutWeight(1)
      .alignItems(HorizontalAlign.Start)
      .margin({ left: 8 })

      Column() {
        Text(`${entry.streak_days}`)
          .fontSize(18).fontWeight(FontWeight.Bold)
          .fontColor($r('app.color.primary_text'))
        Text('è¿ç»­å¤©æ•°')
          .fontSize(10).fontColor($r('app.color.secondary_text'))
          .margin({ top: 2 })
      }
      .alignItems(HorizontalAlign.End)
    }
    .width('100%')
    .padding({ top: 10, bottom: 10 })
  }

  build() {
    // HdsNavDestinationï¼ˆé¦–é¡µ/ç»Ÿè®¡é¡µåŒæ¬¾æ‚¬æµ®æ ‡é¢˜æ ï¼‰ï¼šæ— çº§æ¸å˜æ¨¡ç³Šéšåˆ—è¡¨æ»šåŠ¨è¿ç»­å˜åŒ–
    HdsNavDestination() {
      if (this.isLoading) {
        Column() {
          LoadingProgress()
            .width(44).height(44)
            .color($r('app.color.icon'))
        }
        .width('100%').height('100%')
        .justifyContent(FlexAlign.Center)
      } else if (this.entries.length === 0) {
        Column() {
          Text('æš‚æ— ä¸Šæ¦œè®°å½•')
            .fontSize(16).fontColor($r('app.color.primary_text'))
          Text('å®Œæˆä¸€æ¬¡äº‘ç«¯ç­¾åˆ°åï¼Œè¿™é‡Œå°†å±•ç¤ºå…¨å¹³å°æ’è¡Œæ¦œ')
            .fontSize(13).fontColor($r('app.color.secondary_text'))
            .margin({ top: 8 })
        }
        .width('100%').height('100%')
        .justifyContent(FlexAlign.Center)
      } else {
        Refresh({ refreshing: $$this.isRefreshing }) {
          List({ space: 0, scroller: this.listScroller }) {
            // è®©ä½æ ‡é¢˜æ çš„ç©ºç™½åšæˆåˆ—è¡¨é¦–é¡¹ï¼ˆéšå†…å®¹æ»šåŠ¨æ”¶èµ·ï¼Œä¿è¯æ ‡é¢˜æ æ¸å˜æ¨¡ç³Šç”Ÿæ•ˆï¼Œé¦–é¡µåŒæ¬¾ï¼‰
            ListItem() {
              Column().height(this.statusBarHeight + 56)
            }.width('100%')
            ListItem() {
              this.SummaryCard()
            }.width('100%').padding({ left: 16, right: 16 })
            ListItem() {
              Column() {
                ForEach(this.entries, (entry: LeaderboardEntry, index: number) => {
                  Column() {
                    if (index > 0) {
                      Divider()
                        .color($r('app.color.class_icon_border'))
                    }
                    this.RankItem(entry, index + 1)
                  }
                  .width('100%')
                }, (entry: LeaderboardEntry) => entry.uid.toString())
              }
              .padding(14).width('100%')
              .backgroundColor($r('app.color.card_background'))
              .borderRadius(14)
            }.width('100%').padding({ left: 16, right: 16 }).margin({ top: 10 })
            ListItem() {
              Column().height(24)
            }.width('100%')
          }
          .width('100%').height('100%')
          .scrollBar(BarState.Off)
        }
        .width('100%').height('100%')
        .onRefreshing(async () => { await this.loadData(); }) // ä¸‹æ‹‰åˆ·æ–°æ¦œå•ï¼ˆé¦–é¡µè¯¾ç¨‹åˆ—è¡¨åŒæ¬¾ï¼‰
      }
    }
    .height('100%')
    .width('100%')
    .backgroundColor($r('app.color.page_background'))
    .titleBar({
      content: {
        title: { mainTitle: 'ç­¾åˆ°æ’è¡Œæ¦œ' }
      },
      style: {
        scrollEffectOpts: { // ç³»ç»Ÿçº§æ— çº§æ¸å˜æ¨¡ç³Šï¼ˆé¦–é¡µåŒæ¬¾ï¼‰ï¼šæ¨¡ç³Šé‡éšåˆ—è¡¨æ»šåŠ¨è¿ç»­å˜åŒ–
          enableScrollEffect: true,
          scrollEffectType: ScrollEffectType.GRADIENT_BLUR,
          blurEffectiveEndOffset: LengthMetrics.vp(this.statusBarHeight + 56)
        },
        systemMaterialEffect: this.supportFloatingBar ? { // æ²‰æµ¸å…‰æ„Ÿæè´¨ï¼ˆé¦–é¡µåŒæ¬¾ï¼‰ï¼Œ6.0 èµ°é»˜è®¤æ ·å¼
          materialType: HDS_MATERIAL_TYPE_ADAPTIVE as hdsMaterial.MaterialType,
          materialLevel: HDS_MATERIAL_LEVEL_GENTLE as hdsMaterial.MaterialLevel
        } : undefined
      },
      avoidLayoutSafeArea: false,
      enableComponentSafeArea: false
    })
    .ignoreLayoutSafeArea([LayoutSafeAreaType.SYSTEM], [LayoutSafeAreaEdge.TOP, LayoutSafeAreaEdge.BOTTOM]) // å†…å®¹é“ºæ»¡çŠ¶æ€æ å’Œæ‰‹åŠ¿æ¡ä¹‹ä¸‹
    .bindToScrollable([this.listScroller]) // æ ‡é¢˜æ æ¨¡ç³Šç»‘å®šåˆ—è¡¨æ»šåŠ¨
    .onReady((ctx: NavDestinationContext) => {
      this.pathInfos = ctx.pathStack;
    })
    .onAppear(() => {
      this.loadData()
    })
  }
}
